{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03FA", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\v C", "GROUPCLOSE_0001": "}", "GROUPOPEN_0001": "{", "MATH_0001": "\\begin{align*}\n\\check{\\mathcal{C}}^\\bullet(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{I})\n& =\n\\Mor_{\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})}(\n\\mathbf{Z}_{\\mathcal{U}, \\bullet}, \\mathcal{I}) \\\\\n& =\n\\Mor_{\\textit{PMod}(\\mathbf{Z})}(\n\\mathbf{Z}_{\\mathcal{U}, \\bullet}, \\mathcal{I}) \\\\\n& =\n\\Mor_{\\textit{PMod}(\\mathcal{O})}(\n\\mathbf{Z}_{\\mathcal{U}, \\bullet} \\otimes_{p, \\mathbf{Z}} \\mathcal{O},\n\\mathcal{I})\n\\end{align*}", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\textit{PMod}(\\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Hom_{\\textit{PMod}(\\mathcal{O})}(-, \\mathcal{I})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-cech-map-into}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{sites-modules-lemma-adjointness-tensor-restrict-presheaves}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-injective-module-injective-presheaf}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-complex-tensored-still-exact}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-cech-h0}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:760529f58f971a51755b8566ca146b13a0b193bc05d4d746272c63e6fa54f66a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:029f587d2a2f19533403d5ba6cc67f92a6bc311e5be9016156188e4b80be6647", "source_text": "Lemma <REF_0001> gives the first equality in the following\nsequence of equalities\n<MATH_0001>\nThe third equality by\nModules on Sites,\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nBy Lemma <REF_0003>\nwe see that <MATH_0002> is an injective object in\n<MATH_0003>.\nHence <MATH_0004>\nis an exact functor. By\nLemma <REF_0004> we see the vanishing of\nhigher <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech cohomology groups.\nFor the zeroth see Lemma <REF_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b17490de7081c804b1c5bf8d3eb56fd284f7ffbb055aeb1f62d4446c20ef7e05", "unit_i